<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>P@1 and Latency (annotated) of <span id="S5.F4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">BlockRank</span> vs Full-FT Mistral, scaling <math id="S5.F4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> on MSMarco.</figcaption><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.05396v1/blockrank_vs_fullft_latency.svg" id="S5.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:238/137;" width="238" height="137"></object>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Scalability (RQ2).</h4>

<div id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#S5.F4" title="Figure 4 ‣ In-Domain Performance (RQ1) ‣ 5.2 Main Performance Comparison ‣ 5 Experimental Results ‣ Scalable In-context Ranking with Generative Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> underscores <span id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">BlockRank</span>’s substantial inference efficiency advantage over the Full-FT baseline as the number of in-context documents (<math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>) increases. <span id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">BlockRank</span> model consistently exhibits lower latency; at <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=100</annotation></semantics></math>, it is approximately <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="4.7\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>4.7</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">4.7\times</annotation></semantics></math> faster. More critically, its latency scales linearly with <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, reaching 1.15s at <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=500</annotation></semantics></math>. Furthermore, <span id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">BlockRank</span> model maintains its P@1 (peaking around 29.2% for <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=200" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=200</annotation></semantics></math> and remaining at 28.7% for <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=500</annotation></semantics></math>), whereas Full-FT’s P@1 sharply degrades beyond <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=100</annotation></semantics></math> (dropping to <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx 26.7\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mn>26.7</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx 26.7\%</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=500</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Ablation Studies</h3>

<figure id="S5.T3" class="ltx_table ltx_align_floatright" style="width:50%;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Impact of training loss on Attention-based (Attn) and Decoding (Decode) Inference.</figcaption><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S5.T3.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="128.53" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 238.69 128.53" width="238.69"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,128.53) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.32 L 0 123.21 C 0 126.15 2.38 128.53 5.32 128.53 L 233.37 128.53 C 236.31 128.53 238.69 126.15 238.69 123.21 L 238.69 5.32 C 238.69 2.38 236.31 0 233.37 0 L 5.32 0 C 2.38 0 0 2.38 0 5.32 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FCFCFF;" fill="#FCFCFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 5.32 L 1.38 123.21 C 1.38 125.39 3.15 127.15 5.32 127.15 L 233.37 127.15 C 235.54 127.15 237.3 125.39 237.3 123.21 L 237.3 5.32 C 237.3 3.15 235.54 1.38 233.37 1.38 L 5.32 1.38 C 3.15 1.38 1.38 3.15 1.38 5.32 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 9.26 60.81)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:14.32em;--ltx-fo-height:4.51em;--ltx-fo-depth:4.01em;font-size:10pt;" class="ltx_minipage" height="117.89" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 62.41)" width="15.91em"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<div id="S5.T3.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:143.2pt;height:57.8pt;vertical-align:-27.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-34.1pt,13.7pt) scale(0.677475734350712,0.677475734350712) ;">
<table id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row" rowspan="2"><span id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Training Configuration</span></th>
<td id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" colspan="2"><span id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Precision@1</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="S5.T3.pic1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Decode</span></td>
